at → month-3 repeat → month-6 subscription/rental → month-12 LTV. Attribution stack: GA4 + Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + WhatsApp CTWA + marketplace attribution (Myntra + Ajio + Nykaa Fashion split) + Triple Whale/Northbeam. Fashion-specific: subscription + rental + resale cohorts tracked separately, drop + collab attribution, returns-adjusted margin math. Weekly QBR: channel + creative + audience + collection + drop level ROAS + CAC + LTV/CAC."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Google + Meta + Shopping + PMax allocation for fashion?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Growth-tier: Meta Advantage+ Shopping 30-40%, Google Shopping + PMax 20-25%, Google Search 15-20%, Meta catalog retargeting 10-15%, TikTok/Snapchat/Pinterest 8-15%, WhatsApp CTWA 5-10%. PMax + Advantage+ Shopping excellent for fashion — complete catalog + creative assets + audience signals + LTV-weighted goals. Enable existing customer expansion. Exclude brand terms from PMax. Segment by margin + trend + seasonality via custom labels. In Jeddah, allocation shifts Snapchat 15-25% for KSA, TikTok 15-20% for UAE + Kuwait, Pinterest 10-15% for wedding + occasion + ethnic brands."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"WhatsApp + retention role in fashion performance marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"WhatsApp CTWA drives 20-40% of high-AOV wedding + occasion purchase inquiry + close. WhatsApp Cloud API + Interakt/AiSensy runs: welcome, abandoned cart (25-45% recovery), restock + notify-me (40-60% conversion), drop announcement (3-8x higher drop conversion), post-purchase, styling consultation, subscription/rental management, returns + exchange, winback. Retention delivers 30-50% of month-12+ revenue for well-executed fashion brands. In Jeddah, Arabic + English + Urdu + Malayalam + Indonesian (Hajj season) — WhatsApp templates in local language outperform English 40-60%."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When to add Snapchat + TikTok for fashion in Jeddah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GCC: Snapchat day 1 for KSA (40-50% ad spend), day 30-60 for UAE + Kuwait + Bahrain + Oman (15-25%). TikTok day 30-60 for GCC (15-20%). India: TikTok month 2-4 (10-20% for streetwear + Gen Z). Snapchat rarely justified for India fashion. In Jeddah with Saudi Arabia = Saudi Arabia, add channels 1 at a time + optimise 4-8 weeks before adding next. Streetwear + Gen Z brands add TikTok fastest."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Advantage+ Shopping best practices for fashion?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Complete catalog feed with fashion attributes (colour + size + material + fit + style + occasion). 15-30+ creative assets (Reels + carousel + creator UGC + video + static). Audience signals: existing customer + lookalike + high-intent + interest. Enable existing customer expansion + value-based bidding. Weekly creative refresh (fashion trends move fast). Segment PMax by margin tier + trend + seasonality via custom labels. Exclude brand terms from PMax. In Jeddah, drop-specific PMax campaigns during pre-peak windows drive 3-8x drop-day performance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Creative + audience + measurement pillars for fashion performance marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Creative: 15-30 units/week Growth-tier (Reels + carousel + creator UGC + video PDP + drop teaser + collab campaigns). Audience: LAL of subscribers + high-intent fashion + occasion + style + regional-language + demographic segments. Measurement: LTV/CAC/cohort weekly, ROAS by channel + creative + collection + drop, first-purchase vs LTV split, subscription/rental cohort tracking. In Jeddah, Saudi national + Arab expat + South Asian + Indonesian + Egyptian + Sudanese, Umrah/Hajj-driven seasonal buyer + Ramadan + Eid + Umrah + Hajj (major peak — millions of pilgrims) + Saudi National Day + Red Sea Festival inform audience + creative + measurement segmentation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Common fashion performance marketing mistakes in Jeddah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"(1) Optimising CPA vs LTV. (2) Low creative velocity. (3) No creator UGC in retargeting. (4) Weak Meta CAPI. (5) Ignoring WhatsApp CTWA. (6) Same creative + audience streetwear + wedding + kids. (7) English-only creative GCC. (8) No fit-tech affecting returns (increases effective CPA 30-50% via return-rate lift). (9) Weak marketplace attribution split. (10) Not scaling Snapchat in KSA. (11) Ignoring drop economics + waitlist infrastructure. (12) No LTV/CAC/cohort visibility."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Scaling fashion from SAR 10L to SAR 5 crore/month timeline in Jeddah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"18-30 months well-executed. Longer than perfume/skincare due to seasonal drops + trend cycle + inventory turns + returns compression. Key transitions: (a) SAR 10L → 30L: broaden channel mix (add Google + Shopping + PMax to Meta core), creative velocity 8-15/week, fit-tech + returns programme. (b) SAR 30L → 1 Cr: add WhatsApp Cloud API + subscription/rental + creator programme + drop economics. (c) SAR 1 Cr → 3 Cr: add GCC/multi-region + trilingual + Snapchat/TikTok + celebrity + collab. (d) SAR 3-5 Cr: full multi-channel + multi-region + editorial + PR + investor-grade reporting."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD GrowthLabs run fashion performance marketing in Jeddah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-stack: full-funnel channel mix (Meta + Google + Shopping + PMax + Snapchat + TikTok + Pinterest + WhatsApp CTWA), creative production (in-house pod 15-30 units/week Growth, 30-80/week Enterprise streetwear/drops), attribution stack + LTV/CAC/cohort reporting, fit-tech + returns programme integration, drop + collab + wedding + festive peak campaigns. Grounded in ITD's fashion vertical + case studies (Snitch + Bewakoof + Libas + Urbanic + The Souled Store + Bombay Shirt Company + FabIndia (India); Namshi + Modanisa + local D2C emerging (GCC)). Retainer starts at SAR 3,800-18,000 + ad spend trans